    <rdfs:label>Party Identification Scheme</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>The identification system a party's identifier belongs to: a GS1 Global Location Number, a DUNS number, a tax identifier, a company registration number, an identifier the buyer assigned, an identifier the seller assigned, or one the parties agreed between themselves. A GLN is GS1's and a buyer-assigned number is the buyer's; the record says which.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html#T-PARTY-IDENTIFICATION"/>
  </rdf:Description>
