    <rdfs:label>Order: orderprocessing ordercancelled states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the orderprocessing ordercancelled path of the Order workflow, in order: OrderProcessing, OrderCancelled. A transition is legal between adjacent states. An order's status per schema.org OrderStatus: payment due, processing, in transit, delivered, with pickup, problem, cancellation and return.</rdfs:comment>
