    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdTokenType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Document Type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>What kind of document is referenced: a quotation, a contract, a catalogue, the originator's document, an earlier order, an order response, a despatch advice, a receipt advice, or another document. Revised at the ReceiptAdvice release to name the documents of the chain; the published Order, Order Response and Despatch Advice models keep composing the earlier list.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html#T-DOCUMENT-REFERENCE"/>
  </rdf:Description>
